# ==============================================================
# ATLAS IELTS Academy — frontend build-time overrides
# Copy to frontend/.env only if you need them. Defaults are right
# for development AND docker-compose (vite.config.js proxies /api
# → http://localhost:8000, same-origin, no CORS involved).
# ==============================================================

# Only set this when the frontend is served from a different origin
# than the backend (e.g. a separately deployed static build):
# VITE_API_BASE=/api